"P2476144601" "{HeroName}, you just saved the Walldorf Factory from total destruction. I had no idea that the Council was growing so bold. They think they can bully us into acquiescing to their  leadership. I'd like to say that's impossible, but if it weren't for heroes like you, I don't really know if we could stand against them."
