// IntroString :
"P3226812207" "The Council has been expanding their operations. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>I need a hero to hit the streets and defeat a few Council soldiers.</A> They've been spotted in Independence Port fighting with the Family and the Tsoo, but I'm sure any zone in the city would welcome your assistance."
// AcceptString :
"P1660233133" "Hit the streets and defeat a few Council soldiers"
// SendOffString :
"P1446601283" "The Council is a dangerous foe, {HeroName}. Watch your back."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P2676473982" "Combat Council menace"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P991767494" "I need you to defeat some more Council soldiers."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P359295111" "You have put a dent in the Council's operations."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3518556579" "Thanks for taking on the Council, {HeroName}. If we ever let them get comfortable in Paragon City, they'll certainly grow too big for us to handle."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL4_Council_Errand2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P2662163074" "The neighborhood watch in Independence Port is reporting an increase in Council troops in the area. They seem to be fighting the Tsoo and the Family for territory, and it's resulting in a lot of violence. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>I need you to decrease the Council presence in Independence Port.</a>"
// AcceptString :
"P2262588146" "Decrease the Council presence in Independence Port"
// SendOffString :
"P3840908409" "You can usually find Council soldiers in Bell Point or Wave Landing. Maybe you should start in one of those neighborhoods."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P2218336474" "Combat Council in Independence Port"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3135425674" "The Council is still causing a lot of trouble in Independence Port. Get over there."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2017862147" "You have decreased the Council's presence in Independence Port."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1533666815" "Violence seems to follow the Council wherever they go. Thanks for putting a stop to it, {HeroName}."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL4_Council_Errand3 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P2804999690" "The Council has been getting a lot of recruits from Independence Port recently. It seems their devious power grabs really appeal to some of today's youths. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>I need a hero who can get to Independence Port and stop the Council recruiting.</a> We can't let the Council get any larger than they are!"
// AcceptString :
"P4274432176" "Go to Independence Port and stop the Council recruiting"
// SendOffString :
"P1707275661" "Crey Cove and Industry Pier are crawling with Council soldiers. You might try starting in those neighborhoods."
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P2502994516" "The Council is still recruiting in Independence Port. Someone's got to put a stop to it."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1736365848" "You have discouraged the Council from recruiting in Independence Port."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P310739462" "I think you made an impression on the Council, {HeroName}. Furthermore, you made an impression on the civilians! Nobody will want to join the Council after the sound thrashing you just handed out!"

